            <sparkle:hardwareRequirements>arm64</sparkle:hardwareRequirements>
            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[- Reminders for your own events now always alert, like one-time codes: a calendar app’s “Today at 15:00” or “Leave by…”, and Spark’s “📅 … Starts in 10 minutes”.
- Fixed look-alike notifications, such as Linear updates in Slack, sometimes sharing one row: selecting one selected both, and one of them could be lost.
]]></description>
